      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can confirm, set a raycast on my hand to \"Hit Players\" and it didn't register anyone, only me when I pointed it at myself, and setting it to \"Player\" in \"Hit Custom Layer\" didn't hit anyone. Luckily we can still use VRLabs' Raycast with FinalIK, but it would be awesome to have this fixed",
